ar Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_chassis,_the_wings.\" title=\"The chassis, the wings.\">The chassis, the wings.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enormous_hugeness.\" title=\"Enormous hugeness.\">Enormous hugeness.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dafty_in_the_middle.\" title=\"Dafty in the middle.\">Dafty in the middle.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crumbs_in_my_bralette.\" title=\"Crumbs in my bralette.\">Crumbs in my bralette.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chip_Biffington.\" title=\"Chip Biffington.\">Chip Biffington.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Long-legged_lobster.\" title=\"Long-legged lobster.\">Long-legged lobster.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">The system of endless plates.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_one_that_bats_do.\" title=\"The one that bats do.\">The one that bats do.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_new_business_end.\" title=\"A new business end.\">A new business end.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Did_I_meet_these_potatoes_before%3F\" title=\"Did I meet these potatoes before?\">Did I meet these potatoes before?</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">The system of endless plates.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/e3/The_system_of_endless_plates..png/revision/latest?cb=20221113225929\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"The system of endless plates.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/e3/The_system_of_endless_plates..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20221113225929\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/e3/The_system_of_endless_plates..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20221113225929 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/e3/The_system_of_endless_plates..png/revision/latest?cb=20221113225929 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"The system of endless plates.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"The_system_of_endless_plates..png\" data-image-name=\"The system of endless plates..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_14\" title=\"Series 14\">14</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dara_%C3%93_Briain\" title=\"Dara Ó Briain\">Dara Ó Briain</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Long-legged_lobster.\" title=\"Long-legged lobster.\">Long-legged lobster.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_one_that_bats_do.\" title=\"The one that bats do.\">The one that bats do.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>The system of endless plates.</b></i> is the seventh episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_14\" title=\"Series 14\">Series 14</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 10 November 2022. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Dara_%C3%93_Briain\" title=\"Dara Ó Briain\">Dara Ó Briain</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_system_of_endless_plates.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"The system of endless plates\" was a phrase used by <a href=\"/wiki/Fern_Brady\" title=\"Fern Brady\">Fern Brady</a> to describe her team's strategy for transporting the feather in the <a href=\"/wiki/Get_this_feather_into_the_bath\" title=\"Get this feather into the bath\">Get this feather into the bath</a> task. The title card is of a feather, referencing the same task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_system_of_endless_plates.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'De uendelige mange tallerkerners system', which translates as 'The system of infinite plates'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Loputtomien lautasten järjestelmä', which translates as 'The system of endless plates'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled '99 röda ballonger', which translates as '99 red balloons'. This is a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Pop_99_red_balloons\" title=\"Pop 99 red balloons\">Pop 99 red balloons</a> task.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_system_of_endless_plates.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Dara_%C3%93_Briain\" title=\"Dara Ó Briain\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Dara Ó Briain</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Fern_Brady\" title=\"Fern Brady\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Fern Brady</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/John_Kearns\" title=\"John Kearns\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">John Kearns</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Munya_Chawawa\" title=\"Munya Chawawa\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Munya Chawawa</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sarah_Millican\" title=\"Sarah Millican\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sarah Millican</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_thing_you_would_most_like_to_have_with_you_on_a_car_journey\" title=\"The thing you would most like to have with you on a car journey\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> The thing you would most like to have with you on a car journey.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pop_99_red_balloons\" title=\"Pop 99 red balloons\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Choose a room and a weapon, then wait further instructions.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">0\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">0\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Pop 99 red balloons. You must use your weapon to pop your 99 red balloons. Shout \"Stop it!\" when you think you've popped precisely 99 red balloons.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_this_feather_into_the_bath\" title=\"Get this feather into the bath\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Get this feather into the bath. You must not touch the feather and the feather must not touch the ground. After the feather has left its cushion, it must not touch a single thing for more than five seconds in total. The cushion must not leave the lab. If you make any mistake at all, Alex will blow his whistle and you must start all over again. Finally, you must not say any words at any point from now on.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_an_exercise_ball_touch_Bernard\" title=\"Make an exercise ball touch Bernard\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make an exercise ball touch Bernard. Bernard can't move. You may launch an exercise ball from behind the line and may not touch any balls after each launch.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Blow_an_item_the_furthest_on_the_Knappett\" title=\"Blow an item the furthest on the Knappett\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Blow an item the furthest on the Knappett. If your item falls from the Knappett, you are disqualified. The person who blows something the least far each round is eliminated unless someone is disqualified. You must all select your blowers and items for each round before any blowing commences and you must not use the same blower or item twice.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">21\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td>8\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_system_of_endless_plates.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-